# STAKEHOLDER MANAGEMENT

## Purpose

The purpose of this stakeholder management plan is to identify individuals and groups affected by the Emergency Department Patient Flow Transformation project, understand their influence and expectations, and develop strategies to effectively engage them throughout the project lifecycle.



# STAKEHOLDER IDENTIFICATION

The project involves multiple stakeholders across clinical, operational, technical, financial, and governance areas.

Successful delivery requires effective communication, collaboration, and stakeholder involvement.



